{
  "id": "ep013",
  "duration": 49.22,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 3.69,
      "text": "Standing on the tallest mountain, you wouldn't know you were on one.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Olympus Mons - ESA Mars Express.png",
        "credit": "Jackie Branc",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Olympus_Mons_-_ESA_Mars_Express.png"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.7,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 3.69,
      "end": 12.06,
      "text": "In 1971, the Mariner 9 spacecraft arrived in orbit and confirmed Nix Olympica as a massive volcano.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Mariner09.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mariner09.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 3.7,
          "end": 7.867,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 7.867,
          "end": 12.067,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 12.06,
      "end": 18.755,
      "text": "Olympus Mons stands approximately twenty-one to twenty-five kilometers high on the Martian surface.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "USGS-Mars-MC-17-PhoenicisRegion-mola.png",
        "credit": "USGS (United States Geological Survey)",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:USGS-Mars-MC-17-PhoenicisRegion-mola.png"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 12.067,
          "end": 14.467,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.467,
          "end": 18.767,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 18.755,
      "end": 24.925,
      "text": "That is roughly three times the height of Mount Everest, spreading as wide as the state of Arizona.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Everest, Nuptse, Khumbu Glacier, Himalayas.jpg",
        "credit": "Vyacheslav Argenberg",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Everest,_Nuptse,_Khumbu_Glacier,_Himalayas.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 18.767,
          "end": 21.867,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 21.867,
          "end": 24.933,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 24.925,
      "end": 29.92,
      "text": "Yet its shield volcano profile has an average slope of just five percent.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "\u00dcbergang der Lycus Sulci in Amazonis Planitia (53375301644).jpg",
        "credit": "DLR_de",
        "license": "CC BY 3.0 de",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%C3%9Cbergang_der_Lycus_Sulci_in_Amazonis_Planitia_(53375301644).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 24.933,
          "end": 29.933,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 29.92,
      "end": 37.215,
      "text": "Because of this gentle grade, the ground appears as a plain stretching to a horizon a mere three kilometers away.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "designed card"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 29.933,
          "end": 37.2,
          "kind": "designed",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 37.215,
      "end": 44.49,
      "text": "The summit calderas remain completely out of view, hiding the scale of the largest volcano in the solar system.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Olympus Mons PIA02806.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA/MOLA Science Team (original uploader was Nephelin at de.wikipedia)",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Olympus_Mons_PIA02806.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 37.2,
          "end": 44.5,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 44.49,
      "end": 48.87,
      "text": "That is why standing on the tallest mountain, you wouldn't know you were on one.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Olympus Mons - ESA Mars Express.png",
        "credit": "Jackie Branc",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Olympus_Mons_-_ESA_Mars_Express.png"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 44.5,
          "end": 49.233,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
